              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-6__qstr-1__sec-963AA">
                  <num>963AA</num>
                  <heading>Benefits given in relation to life risk insurance products</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>		The regulations may prescribe circumstances, in addition to those set out in <ref href="#sec-963A">section 963A</ref>, in which a benefit given to a financial services licensee, or a representative of a financial services licensee, in relation to a life risk insurance product, or life risk insurance products, is <b><i>conflicted remuneration</i></b>.</p>
